            <div xml:id="m-4be65f40-913e-4621-9fa3-f88b1fd1a7d3">
              <lg xml:id="m-365f4953-9ec1-42a8-877f-a8679c8be8ae">
                <l xml:id="m-707a11a0-e9ed-4778-a305-eb2c5f830efa" facs="#m-c845515d-9f06-49c1-b042-0bcf9f9fed06" label="ambiguous">Easter Tuesday.</l><l xml:id="m-aa26abb0-1bd4-4a64-a98a-e6ab52cbfc09" facs="#m-913ca889-eea3-453b-97c1-b2244e5a546c" label="ambiguous">701</l><l xml:id="m-cf567f6f-4bc4-4acc-b73f-fac89e944c88" facs="#m-b445c5a8-d0da-4df2-956c-68273b1ccf73" label="lyrics-like">Sequence. Victimae Pascháli. with Allelúia. at the end, p. 780.</l><l xml:id="m-da8c426c-e886-45b2-b998-8413a3c1a923" facs="#m-335a8613-f109-4ea1-bf67-b1c245ac241f" label="ambiguous">4 Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Lucam. Luc. 24.c.</l><l xml:id="m-38b27c0d-39a6-4908-b80f-0502244919b8" facs="#m-da6a8ab3-15da-4d2e-b8e9-a0e5e8fa13d7" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Stetit Jesus in et favum mellis. Et cum manducás¬</l><l xml:id="m-dfb09d06-5e2b-426e-86e0-c0ecc4d6305c" facs="#m-0083fa97-ac06-4702-82ef-fab4bfbf0a06" label="lyrics-like">L médio discipulórum suórum, et</l><l xml:id="m-70d3e275-c626-4bdb-9a6a-324b83ce2477" facs="#m-24183f97-bea2-469b-83e2-1ca25ed7a77c" label="lyrics-like">set coram eis, sumens relíquias,</l><l xml:id="m-2075982d-7af3-4cf1-ae25-2b8c24819b4e" facs="#m-9d89d9d1-2eb6-48be-a697-67ee1e8ef72a" label="ambiguous">dicit eis: Pax vobis: ego sum,</l><l xml:id="m-b86ddab1-7392-4c50-8557-d0521972a979" facs="#m-1776afec-5a85-4af1-8759-fab48bfc263c" label="ambiguous">dedit eis. Et dixit ad eos: Haec</l><l xml:id="m-44454bcc-ff36-484d-9f88-2ac3cf780381" facs="#m-f3a779f9-9203-4502-b78e-3c92af86ef84" label="lyrics-like">nolite timére. Conturbáti vero, et</l><l xml:id="m-bde93c6f-2310-4321-bb11-53687927471b" facs="#m-7f43e18c-ef93-43fd-b995-298506b653e2" label="lyrics-like">sunt verba, quae locútus sum ad</l><l xml:id="m-de61d636-0aa0-437d-a0ab-785d97e63931" facs="#m-4a465544-ed2a-462a-8fca-d829795b453a" label="lyrics-like">contérriti, existimábant se spiritum</l><l xml:id="m-c6551256-4677-419d-9fac-e7763f443ae8" facs="#m-77216cd2-cf61-471d-a6d8-638b18bb32bc" label="ambiguous">vos, cum adhuc essem vobiscum,</l><l xml:id="m-ff395dc4-2528-4b18-aec1-cef8bd0c2ac8" facs="#m-917d7030-fabb-4414-8932-b8bb1bc6de25" label="lyrics-like">vidére. Et dixit eis: Quid turbáti</l><l xml:id="m-c74f8213-d0b7-43ac-a43e-b25781e7f144" facs="#m-d8944b8f-9385-46ce-b0f1-f994b124162c" label="lyrics-like">quóniam necésse est impléri ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-cf05f44c-291c-4d00-b230-25afae0ccb34" facs="#m-fcf5fdf4-451c-4d81-9b61-4710464a46e7" label="lyrics-like">quae scripta sunt in lege Móysi, et</l><l xml:id="m-ea0ec36f-7409-4e39-b488-9c9f8ccdae3e" facs="#m-fe9826c3-c407-46a5-8b8f-e067847d99ee" label="lyrics-like">estis, et cogitatiónes ascéndunt in</l><l xml:id="m-87deb230-a97f-41fd-bc29-0c4a14bae018" facs="#m-d7e4f47e-d683-4187-aeab-819c399bd31d" label="lyrics-like">corda vestrã? Vidéte manus meas,</l><l xml:id="m-b8978d71-d268-42c1-9873-971dd119e15a" facs="#m-c4839037-e8d2-4cdc-b1f3-e5af9fb6fe5c" label="lyrics-like">Prophétis, et Psalmis de me. Tunc</l><l xml:id="m-18b7de7b-7b37-4199-8ce9-07ecd80d1afb" facs="#m-25e10ff5-e696-4016-bdd4-a4e2ee6bd587" label="lyrics-like">et pedes, quia ego ipse sum: palpá¬</l><l xml:id="m-daa45879-1a15-48ff-98b5-e6addcf706ea" facs="#m-e36a0750-bcb9-4fdb-9a3c-ae6580ebf7f0" label="lyrics-like">apéruit illis sensum, ut intelligerent</l><l xml:id="m-39201917-771c-41c5-8aa4-5147622a3e22" facs="#m-3fa25435-9a54-4ca1-a9d0-de86a37264ad" label="lyrics-like">scriptúras. Et dixit eis: Quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-4fa5d8bf-6c00-4502-b05f-b985217b614c" facs="#m-8a1ce7d4-9905-467c-bf06-fb6960f6a28b" label="lyrics-like">te, et vidéte: quia spíritus carnem,</l><l xml:id="m-67733a99-8700-430d-84b3-eed493d60ec7" facs="#m-34dead9d-8c66-4f52-934b-0fd9b9a60ada" label="lyrics-like">et ossa non habet, sicut me vidétis</l><l xml:id="m-b75971f0-9b6e-4fcb-a498-1908d2eabe47" facs="#m-32005e0c-6c2f-45c3-886b-9dcf37edde85" label="lyrics-like">sic scriptum est, et sic oportébat</l><l xml:id="m-dd7b54d9-ac94-400c-b0e4-f5fd74e0568f" facs="#m-1c8f274e-44c8-48fb-87f5-f634cad7fd24" label="lyrics-like">habére. Et cum hoc dixisset, ostén¬</l><l xml:id="m-e477d412-4d1d-42da-bd5e-089b95e1d8f9" facs="#m-de4c292a-56e2-4107-a7c9-4897a311a493" label="lyrics-like">Christum pati, et resúrgere a mór¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcc65c0e-002b-40db-b99d-25329ac70f9c" facs="#m-c5463f00-5b3d-401f-a3cf-e6dc78eee738" label="ambiguous">dit eis manus, et pedes. Adhuc au¬</l><l xml:id="m-599975f8-702d-467a-85a2-60591dcbeb17" facs="#m-8beb62bd-9372-4e66-8ce1-4f05d7614ae3" label="lyrics-like">tuis tértia die: et praedicári in nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6de15892-70a7-4278-8d86-6d7567de84da" facs="#m-9e4d2420-fe76-4835-bf67-fc3ef49d7555" label="lyrics-like">tem illis non credéntibus, et mirán¬</l><l xml:id="m-8f0257ad-1dc1-45b4-bb2e-a4bb518d34fc" facs="#m-2afa718e-a79e-4f1c-8e91-fd5870096b0a" label="lyrics-like">mine ejus paeniténtiam, et remis¬</l><l xml:id="m-429e6a5a-11cb-48f9-8933-68da0708a16e" facs="#m-6c80c963-c4d4-4c55-bef3-b18d0c750272" label="lyrics-like">tibus prae gáudio, dixit: Habétis</l><l xml:id="m-a2506957-a15a-4e64-90ac-443b6116668d" facs="#m-ac91d970-142c-4456-b0d0-74a21fa52bc8" label="lyrics-like">siónem peccatórum in omnes gen¬</l><l xml:id="m-64dabd56-133f-4a73-b3ea-f2cba529c664" facs="#m-bbc4a92f-523e-49fb-a907-6b6785f3b11a" label="lyrics-like">hic áliquid, quod manducétur? At</l><l xml:id="m-99549133-d7ac-4996-a11c-36c7e5872999" facs="#m-f7795e61-7f13-4a12-b821-7762cc055156" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-1a47f6f0-4990-478a-85ec-222581d93a3e" facs="#m-9acacd3d-307a-430e-959d-37b5a22ad919" label="ambiguous">tes.</l><l xml:id="m-7cc2e258-1372-47bf-8c09-d74388ff92d5" facs="#m-b0ba47d3-2a27-4dd2-b8f8-5d59630ac574" label="lyrics-like">illi obtulérunt ei partem piscis assi,</l><l xml:id="m-a9d878c2-2b7f-4d8c-875b-05c71905883d" facs="#m-4af33ec0-8f89-40f6-87c9-8f738b2466a0" label="ambiguous">ofert.E</l><l xml:id="m-9497cb96-ae5b-477f-8515-db79f8388ea0" facs="#m-9b1458c9-5b66-496f-bc80-800fce9af722" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-0d1a9b68-b1b0-4bb4-922b-64aad04eeb22" facs="#m-3987b02f-b018-4585-91a0-abde03894a5a" label="lyrics-like">Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1710e9ca-268d-437d-b77e-18fe28e164bb" facs="#m-070baa65-a8e5-4a8e-aa24-69257f6cca74" label="lyrics-like">Ntónu- it" de caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5fb39e3-8e1e-443e-945c-32a9d3fe6bd3" facs="#m-8942c1e3-bec9-4ac9-9151-199bdc5c35b8" label="ambiguous">lo</l><l xml:id="m-7992bf32-d30c-444e-8f5d-f68fce1552e1" facs="#m-0637f8d2-83d3-4fa7-b038-7f07db4bf1a0" label="lyrics-like">dé¬ dit vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-73cc5d0e-38d2-4045-886c-47bc5712add0" facs="#m-f9bc5e7e-7e45-47d3-bc52-d055e350abea" label="lyrics-like">mi- nus, et Altís- si-mus</l><l xml:id="m-0c7e09cf-cbf0-4824-b213-2f7c5a5c6440" facs="#m-f3d70294-a259-4671-8670-555fb21e0626" label="ambiguous">cem</l><l xml:id="m-69e22a38-0877-43e9-81f0-0e706f7a4c4d" facs="#m-00f24070-495c-4e12-a5b1-2fd169f90d9f" label="lyrics-like">sú- am: et appa¬ ru-é- runt fóntes aquá- rum,</l><l xml:id="m-6c787a4a-3379-462d-86f2-c4b730d09c4f" facs="#m-2c1b24aa-9839-4ec6-ac60-f9c9aecb10b5" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f156f53-0770-4d59-b848-7c877d4dee85" facs="#m-d3333367-3ed6-407a-be78-c11857207ba0" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-e3a09a98-db3f-4459-80f6-bca150c861bc" facs="#m-cfcf2c9d-d9a8-42e9-8ccf-6764882ad8aa" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-566b0397-9951-4524-9479-ae79a92cab65" facs="#m-99d0a5dd-23de-48b4-a8ab-241fa92b4c1c" label="lyrics-like">NUscipe, Dómine, fidélium preces! caeléstem glóriam transeámus. Per</l><l xml:id="m-a57a94b9-0784-4f20-9cdd-62a8924ac60c" facs="#m-fa53bbfa-dce4-482f-9d9f-7d1e3ecc8b3f" label="lyrics-like">Dcum oblatiónibus hostiárum :ut</l><l xml:id="m-4409896e-41a0-4448-8e79-c5b4d771ea69" facs="#m-a8586ac2-a476-4c6b-bef1-2b344a480eab" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e70e75e7-0681-479c-a7b1-76dc43ef22c5" facs="#m-f08a761f-b4f3-4747-bbc1-a8192c2e91d2" label="lyrics-like">per haec piae devotiónis officia, ad</l><l xml:id="m-dfc59d85-9738-4ae9-82de-e29e18f1b68d" facs="#m-ba2f0001-747f-4025-a9b3-8a45d5ae7295" label="text-like">Preface. Easter Sunday, p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-33698d65-8ea3-49bb-91c5-456bdbd7cc39" facs="#m-9140dbda-e915-4031-9290-bb816ef77d2a" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-96b32462-0f8f-483d-a0f6-03130a9ab46d" facs="#m-e0f88c6e-4db0-4462-9409-ab36961216a6" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-24381d45-820e-4d48-bebe-9c8a2d7c89d3" facs="#m-ee7bd98f-e398-43f6-a702-c4d386fcec92" label="ambiguous">S</l><l xml:id="m-50edffb3-5f01-479a-ae85-b0f9378f36ef" facs="#m-6ebe913a-6d76-4416-9a86-44b3b64bc1bc" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-27b56644-7201-41b7-a7d2-3e7d6e003271" facs="#m-dafb8e15-6ca4-4767-9f90-a5372d032de3" label="lyrics-like">cum Chrí-sto,</l><l xml:id="m-9de42b37-8bc4-4fce-a840-2422805953c5" facs="#m-ce4defa3-83c8-4678-b5c4-2709f03cb059" label="lyrics-like">consur-rexístis</l><l xml:id="m-ac53e463-bcb1-4c49-8a8d-b6c731ec6603" facs="#m-2fab7b47-bad9-4d61-a7cd-a01a565fed40" label="ambiguous">quae sur¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>